Version 0.9-3
-------------

(mab) Move VOC back to dynamic file. This file is constantly being accessed by SD.  Having it as a Directory file results constant file opens.
      With having it as a Dynamic file the hope is most of the file is already buffered.
      Note: Existing Accounts with VOC defined as a Directory file type will still work, just have more overhead.
